    seconds: 1
  - kind: 2
    actor: 0
    text: 
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: TalkNervous
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: 0
    text: Um... I don't know if I can. Everyone will be looking at me.
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 2
    actor: 0
    text: 
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: Nervous
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 3
    actor: 0
    text: How is Lina feeling?
    emotion: 4
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: Lina feels scared, or nervous. Her eyes are wide open and her eyebrows go up.
    hint: 'Look at Lina''s eyes and eyebrows: they are wide and raised. She is worried about reading in front of everyone.'
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 4
    actor: 0
    text: What could you say to Lina?
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options:
    - label: You can do it! I'll listen.
      icon: {fileID: -3546158302737474875, guid: 94c7f6f3655f349ab8876aa35543302e, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.8745098, g: 0.9529412, b: 0.8901961, a: 1}
    - label: Ha ha, you're scared!
      icon: {fileID: -661642422251089062, guid: 3f2fc40b72151487bb608a79360b9d5f, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.94509804, b: 0.72156864, a: 1}
    - label: Hurry up!
      icon: {fileID: -365116588634130010, guid: 43dedd82599b54b7fbd5112490dffd1c, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.8627451, b: 0.8392157, a: 1}
    - label: Say nothing
      icon: {fileID: 938587893661617443, guid: e7eaa64d31b364ddb8416abf387f0ae6, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.9019608, b: 0.9411765, a: 1}
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: What a good friend!
    praise: Kind words help someone feel brave. Lina knows you are on her side.
    hint: Laughing or rushing her would make Lina feel worse. What could you say to help her feel brave?
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: -1
    text: You can do it, Lina! I'll listen.
